@startuml corpus-wikipedia-state
' WikipediaIterator is a four-flag state machine over quick-xml pull events.
' A Document is emitted only at </page>, and only if all four filters pass.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/corpus-wikipedia-state.puml
' Source of truth for Figure 2 in docs/components/corpus/formats.md, section "Wikipedia XML dumps".
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowFontColor #37474F
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #546E7A
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  BorderColor #263238
  AttributeFontColor #263238
  StartColor #455A64
  EndColor #455A64
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
}
title WikipediaIterator — a pull-parser state machine over the MediaWiki XML dump

[*] --> Idle

state "**Idle**\noutside any <page>" as Idle #90A4AE
state "**InPage**\nin_page = true\ntitle / text / ns cleared" as InPage #546E7A
state "**InTitle**\naccumulating <title>" as InTitle #1565C0
state "**InNs**\nparsing <ns> as i32" as InNs #1565C0
state "**InText**\naccumulating <text>\n(Text and CData events)" as InText #1565C0
state "**Gate**\nevaluated at </page>" as Gate #1565C0
state "**Emit**\nDocument { id = title, title,\ncontent = normalized, source = None }" as Emit #455A64

Idle --> InPage : Start(<page>)
InPage --> InTitle : Start(<title>)
InTitle --> InPage : End(</title>)
InPage --> InNs : Start(<ns>)
InNs --> InPage : End(</ns>)
InPage --> InText : Start(<text>)
InText --> InPage : End(</text>)
InPage --> Gate : End(</page>)

Gate --> Idle : ✗ any filter fails ⇒ **continue** (article skipped)
Gate --> Emit : ✓ all four pass
Emit --> Idle : yield Document;\narticles_read += 1
Idle --> [*] : Event::Eof, or\narticles_read = max_articles

note right of Gate
  **The four filters, in order**
  1. namespace_filter.contains(ns)   (default: [0], main space)
  2. skip_redirects ∧ text starts with #REDIRECT / #redirect
  3. text.len() ≥ min_text_length   (default: 100 **bytes**)
  4. after strip_wiki_markup + normalize:
     normalized.len() ≥ min_text_length  (re-checked)
end note

note bottom of InText
  A malformed-XML event is **logged and skipped**
  (the loop continues), so one corrupt page cannot
  abort a multi-hour import.
end note
@enduml
